WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:07,950
Come in quickly, I'll have someone stew red date and ginger soup for you. You should drink a bowl first to warm yourself up.

2
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:15,750
Ayu is back. Yesterday, my father thought about how long the snow will last. When the snow stops, he will ask you to return to being a little pig for a few days.

3
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:19,050
It just so happened that I came back, and my father and I had a good rapport.

4
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:26,010
It's been a while since you started spring.

5
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:29,530
Not getting pregnant is not my problem.

6
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,820
What is your enemy?

7
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:35,260
I just came to Lux.

8
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,620
No wonder I see you looking so weak today.

9
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,580
It's been cold for days, and it's most likely to be cold and hurt your body.

10
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,060
You must take good care of yourself and don't be too pushy and get hurt.
